)F FUNCTION -                                                           01000002
  THE DELETE COMMAND IS USED TO DELETE EITHER VSAM OBJECTS OR NONVSAM   02000002
  DATA SETS FROM A VSAM CATALOG AND TO FREE SPACE OCCUPIED BY THE       03000002
  OBJECTS OR DATA SETS.  ALSO THE FREE SPACE OF VSAM DATA COMPONENTS    04000002
  CAN BE OVERWRITTEN WITH ZEROS.   THE DELETE COMMAND ALSO DELETES      05000003
  GDG BASES AND VSAM USERCATALOGS.                                      05050003
)X SYNTAX -                                                             06000002
         DELETE    ('ENTRYNAME/PASSWORD' ...)                           07000002
                   CATALOG('CATNAME/PASSWORD')                          08000003
                   FILE('DNAME')                                        09000002
                   PURGE | NOPURGE                                      10000002
                   ERASE | NOERASE                                      11000002
                   SCRATCH | NOSCRATCH                                  12000002
                   FORCE | NOFORCE                                      12050003
                   CLUSTER | SPACE | USERCATALOG |                      13000003
                       ALIAS | GENERATIONDATAGROUP | PAGESPACE |        14000002
                       NONVSAM | PATH | ALTERNATEINDEX                  15000003
  REQUIRED - 'ENTRYNAME'                                                16000002
             SPACE (IF APPLICABLE)                                      17000002
             USERCATALOG (IF APPLICABLE)                                18000002
  DEFAULTS - NOPURGE                                                    20000002
             SCRATCH                                                    21000002
             NOFORCE                                                    21010003
  ABBREVIATIONS -                                                       21050002
      NOTE - IN ADDITION TO NORMAL TSO SHORT FORMS, THESE ARE ACCEPTED. 21100002
             DELETE               DEL                                   21200002
             PURGE                PRG                                   21300002
             FORCE                FRC                                   21310003
             NOFORCE              NFRC                                  21320003
             NOPURGE              NPRG                                  21350002
             NOERASE              NERAS                                 21450002
             NOSCRATCH            NSCR                                  21550002
             SPACE                SPC                                   21650002
             USERCATALOG          UCAT                                  21700002
             GENERATIONDATAGROUP  GDG                                   21800002
             PAGESPACE            PGSPC                                 21850002
             NONVSAM              NVSAM                                 21900002
             ALTERNATEINDEX       AIX                                   21950003
)O OPERANDS -                                                           22000002
  'ENTRYNAME/PASSWORD'                                                  23000002
           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF ENTRY TO BE DELETED.                 24000002
  'ENTRYNAME'                                                           25000002
           - NAME OF ENTRY TO BE DELETED.                               26000002
  'PASSWORD'                                                            27000002
           - PASSWORD FOR PASSWORD-PROTECTED CLUSTER, PAGE SPACE,       28000003
             CATALOG, ALTERNATE INDEX, OR PATH.                         29000003
  REQUIRED - 'ENTRYNAME'                                                30000002
))CATALOG('CATNAME/PASSWORD')                                           31000003
           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF CATALOG CONTAINING THE ENTRIES TO BE 32000002
             DELETED.                                                   32500002
  'CATNAME'                                                             33000002
           - NAME OF CATALOG CONTAINING THE ENTRIES TO BE DELETED.      34000002
  'PASSWORD'                                                            35000002
           - MASTER LEVEL PASSWORD OF THE CATALOG.                      36000002
  REQUIRED - 'CATNAME'                                                  40000002
))FILE('DNAME')                                                         41000002
           - SPECIFIES THE LOCATION OF THE OBJECT TO BE DELETED.        42000002
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES EITHER THE VOLUME 43000002
             CONTAINING THE OBJECT TO BE DELETED OR THE DATA SET TO BE  44000002
             DELETED.                                                   45000002
))FORCE    - THE OBJECT IS TO BE DELETED EVEN THOUGH NOT EMPTY.         45050003
             THIS APPLIES ONLY TO OBJECTS THAT NORMALLY MUST BE         45100003
             EMPTY TO BE DELETED.                                       45150003
))NOFORCE  - THE OBJECT IS NOT TO BE DELETED IF IT IS NOT               45200003
             EMPTY.                                                     45250003
))PURGE    - THE OBJECT IS TO BE DELETED REGARDLESS OF EXPIRATION DATE. 46000002
))NOPURGE  - THE OBJECT IS NOT TO BE DELETED BEFORE EXPIRATION DATE.    47000002
))ERASE    - THE DATA COMPONENT OF THE CLUSTER IS TO BE OVERWRITTEN     48000002
             WITH BINARY ZEROS.                                         49000002
))NOERASE  - THE DATA COMPONENT OF THE CLUSTER IS NOT BE TO OVERWRITTEN 50000002
             WITH BINARY ZEROS.                                         51000002
))SCRATCH  - THE NONVSAM DATA SET BEING DELETED FROM THE CATALOG IS TO  52000002
             BE REMOVED FROM THE VTOC OF THE VOLUME ON WHICH IT         53000002
             RESIDES.   WHEN SCRATCH IS SPECIFIED FOR A CLUSTER,        54000003
             ALTERNATEINDEX, PAGESPACE, OR DATA SPACE, THE VTOCS        54050003
             OF THE VOLUMES INVOLVED ARE UPDATED TO REFLECT THE         54100003
             DELETION OF THE OBJECT.                                    54150003
))NOSCRATCH                                                             55000002
           - THE NONVSAM DATA SET BEING DELETED FROM THE CATALOG IS TO  56000002
             REMAIN IN THE VTOC OF THE VOLUME ON WHICH IT RESIDES       57000003
             OR IT HAS ALREADY BEEN SCRATCHED FROM THE VTOC.            57010003
             WHEN NOSCRATCH IS SPECIFIED FOR A CLUSTER, PAGESPACE,      57050003
             ALTERNATEINDEX, OR DATA SPACE, THE VTOCS OF THE            57100003
             VOLUMES INVOLVED ARE NOT UPDATED.                          57150003
))CLUSTER  - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A CLUSTER.        58000002
))SPACE    - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A DATA SPACE.     59000002
             REQUIRED IF APPLICABLE.                                    60000002
))USERCATALOG                                                           61000002
           - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A USER CATALOG.   62000002
             REQUIRED IF APPLICABLE.                                    63000002
))ALIAS    - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR AN ALIAS.         67000002
))GENERATIONDATAGROUP                                                   68000002
           - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A GENERATION DATA 69000002
             GROUP.                                                     70000002
))PAGESPACE                                                             71000002
           - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A PAGE SPACE.     72000002
))NONVSAM  - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A NONVSAM DATA    73000002
             SET.                                                       74000002
))PATH     - THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR A PATH.           74050003
))ALTERNATEINDEX -                                                      74100003
             THE ENTRY TO BE DELETED IS THE ENTRY FOR AN                74150003
             ALTERNATE INDEX.                                           74200003
